      https://www.mdpi.com/2227-7390/12/17/2705
    description: >-
      Improved Apriori Method for Safety Signal Detection Using Post-Marketing Clinical Data
repository-code: 'https://github.com/rsarkar2/improvedApriori_RPackage'
abstract: >-
  R package to identify frequently co-occurring drug/vaccine and adverse event (AE) pairs 
  from safety datasets using either the classical Apriori method ("Confidence" as second 
  hyperparameter) or an improved Apriori method (using "ROR", "RR", or "PRR" as the second 
  hyperparameter
keywords:
  - data mining
  - safety signal detection
